CELL e8-nm EXIT 0
KCMP RESULT cell e8-nm equal 1 control_drop_unequal 1 control_added_unequal 1
SPAN RESULT cell e8-nm span_equal 0
KCMP DONE cell e8-nm
CELL e8-np EXIT 0
KCMP RESULT cell e8-np equal 1 control_drop_unequal 1 control_added_unequal 1
SPAN RESULT cell e8-np span_equal 0
KCMP DONE cell e8-np
CELL iso-nm EXIT 0
KCMP RESULT cell iso-nm equal 1 control_drop_unequal 1 control_added_unequal 1
KCMP DONE cell iso-nm
KCOMPARE ALL DONE
